WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:04.080
Quiero ser honesto con todos ustedes.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.360
Nothing can be built on lies.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.520
What do you mean?

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.920
And what was that?

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.000
It's your brother.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.560
He's got a new hobby.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.280
He set up a shooting wrench

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.400
on the back lawn.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.040
Sorry.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.000
Yeah.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:24.680
Henry's taking up shooting?
